        <mxCell id="b_min" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#43a047;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;minute_counter (Modulo-60)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#274e13&#39; style=&#39;font-size:10px;&#39;&gt;r_min[5:0] &amp; r_min_bak[5:0]&lt;br&gt;• RUN: Tăng theo sec_rollover&lt;br&gt;• ADJ_MIN: Chỉnh +/-1 (Wrap)&lt;br&gt;• Rollback về snapshot khi cancel&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
